    "head_branch": "feature/retire-gdscript-sim",
    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): retire the GDScript tick, the crate the whole simulation\n\nSpec 39 step 9d-iv. No GDScript plays the tick now:\n\n- sim/ is gone (FormationSimulation, its glue, the views of the crate's\n  squads and units, FormationField, BattleTrials, FormationBench and the\n  rest), with every gdUnit file under tests/sim/ but the five that test\n  the kept bindings.\n- lib.rs loses the bindings only sim/ called (BodyField, TerrainGround,\n  UnitMoves, GroundPaths, GroundMarch, ScrumRules, SquadRoster) and the\n  digest bindings; crate functions only cargo tests still call are\n  #[cfg(test)].\n- The five checks that scanned only sim/'s GDScript retire with it.\n- SimBuild (Decision 130) fingerprints the crate's source and the\n  content, in place of res://sim/.\n\nNo rules change; the digests hash the same bytes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5vg4Sbbd9qACzRSQr",
